# Home Network & DC01 Configuration

## Lab Environment

This lab is built in my personal home environment using a
PLDT home internet connection and VMware Workstation.

The Windows Server VM is connected through VMware NAT, allowing
the virtual machine to access the Internet through my physical
PC's PLDT connection.

## Network Architecture

